{
 "about": "NPC encoding for Tongari Boushi to Oshare na Mahou Tsukai (NDS). The save file stores friend / met-NPC u16 LE values in body 0x500..0x4300 (slot A in active save). The stored_value is `npc_data_ofs_id + 500`, where npc_data_ofs_id is the position 0..251 in NpcDataOfs.ofs / NpcData.dec. The 252 NPCs span 4 categories matching tfnpc.ofs (cat 0, 140 main NPCs), tfnpccmn.ofs (cat 1, 33 staff/special), tfnpcguest.ofs (cat 2, 13 guest/event NPCs), and a 4th category of 66 mythical/creature NPCs.",
 "method": "stored_value = npc_data_ofs_id + 500. Confirmed via differential save analysis (Tyler's OLD vs NEW saves with 2 added friends), cross-checked against ARM9 NPC tables (RAM 0x020A1660: cat bases [1000,2000,3000,4000] for speaker_npc_id namespace; RAM 0x020A1670: counts [140,33,13,66]; RAM 0x020A1690: cumulative starts [0,140,173,186]). The save file uses a flat 0..251 namespace + 500 offset; the speaker_npc_id namespace (1000+, used by the dialog system) is a separate addressing scheme. Both reference the same NpcDataOfs.ofs entries in identical order.",
 "tables": {
  "ram_addr_cat_bases_speaker_namespace": "0x020A1660",
  "file_offset_cat_bases": "0xA1660",
  "ram_addr_cat_counts": "0x020A1670",
  "file_offset_cat_counts": "0xA1670",
  "ram_addr_cumulative_starts": "0x020A1690",
  "file_offset_cumulative_starts": "0xA1690",
  "speaker_npc_id_decoder_function_ram": "0x0203522c",
  "flat_index_returner_function_ram": "0x02035288",
  "save_buffer_save_offset_low": "0x500",
  "save_buffer_save_offset_high": "0x4300",
  "save_offset_region_size_bytes": 15616,
  "stored_value_range_low": 500,
  "stored_value_range_high": 751,
  "note": "The save offset region body 0x500..0x4300 contains the active NPC met-history / friend-list data; the same u16 stored_value may appear in multiple sub-tables (encounter log, friend list, gift log, etc.) within that region. Specific sub-region offsets within 0x500..0x4300 are not yet fully decoded; this encoding is for the u16 NPC ID value itself."
 },
